{
    "title": "Alarmy - Alarm Clock & Sleep",
    "description": "Boost your motivation for successful mornings with Alarmy!\r\nThe wellness app for waking up and making a better sleep cycle.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 No.1 Alarm clock & Sleep App with 75M Users\r\nRated No. 1 in over 90 countries with 1.7M store reviews.\r\nSelected as the 2023 Google Play App of the Year.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Waking up at once with Alarm Missions\r\nHaving trouble waking up with just a sound?\r\nTry our variety of waking up missions:\r\nmath solving, memory games, shaking, or squats.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Special Alarm Clock for Heavy Sleepers\r\nIf you're a heavy sleeper who can't wake up with regular alarm clock,\r\nour features like [ Power Off Prevention & Anti-Snooze ] \r\nwill ensure you never fall back asleep.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Snore & Sleep Tracker\r\nCheck if you snored last night\r\nand whether you slept deeply using our sleep tracker,\r\nwhich includes features to check the severity of snoring and your sleep cycle.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Quick and Deep Sleep with Calm Sleep Sounds\r\nFor those who struggle to fall asleep, \r\nwe offer a variety of calm sleep sounds:\r\ncalm ASMR, rain sounds, white noise.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Regular Night Routine with Bedtime Alarms\r\nCreating a regular night routine habit can lead to more fresh mornings.\r\nRemind bedtime at your set schedule and turn on calm sleep sounds.\r\nIt'll boost motivation for building a habit of going to bed regularly for a better sleep routine.\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0e Recommended for:\r\n- Those who set multiple alarms minutes apart\r\n- People who work early or night shifts\r\n- Anyone looking for a stronger alarm than the Google clock or Apple alarm clock\r\n- Those who need to improve their sleep routine due to chronic fatigue\r\n- People curious about whether they snore or not\r\n- Those who need various calm sleep sounds to fall asleep easily\r\n- Those who want to make successful morning & evening habit with the full motivation\r\n- Anyone needs a free sleep tracker to make regular sleep cycle\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\n\u25b6 Life Hacking Tips with Alarmy\r\n\r\n*Morning Study Routine: Study Habit\r\n1. Choose 'Photo Mission' as the alarm dismissal mission\r\n2. Set the cover of the book you will study as the photo mission.\r\n3. Then, you can start studying as soon as the alarm goes off and build a habit!\r\n\r\n*Night Sleep Routine: Habit to Combat Insomnia\r\n1. Set your target sleeping time and set up a 'Bedtime Reminder' and wake-up alarm.\r\n2. When it's bedtime, turn on the sleep tracker and calm sounds.\r\n3. Maintain this routine for over 5 days to see changes in your sleep cycle, and complete your perfect night routine!\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nAlarmy is daily source of motivation for morning waking up,\r\nbut it also offers various sleeping functions.\r\n\r\nSleeping well is crucial for waking up easily,\r\nwhich is why we provide calm sleep sounds and sleep tracker related to forming sleep cycle for free.\r\n\r\nExperience all the features to spark your motivation of successful morning \r\nand a healthy routine, habit all at once with Alarmy!\r\n\r\nFree features: alarm clock, sleep tracker, sleep sounds etc.\r\n\r\n#clock #clock app #alarm clock #clock widget #loud #motivation #sleep cycle #sleep sounds #sleep tracker #habit #rem sleep #calm #sleep recorder\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nPERMISSIONS\r\nSYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW (Android window permission)\r\nNeeded for displaying the alarm dismissal screen on Android 10 and above.\r\n\r\nOPTIONAL PERMISSIONS\r\nService can be used without agreement, except for:\r\n\r\n- Write External Storage: Needed to load external ringtones.\r\n- Camera: Required for photo missions where users need to take pictures.\r\n- Read External Storage: Needed to save photos taken by users in photo missions.\r\n- Location Information: Needed to obtain weather information after the app is closed.\r\n- Device Manager: Used to prevent the app from being uninstalled.\r\n\r\nAlarmy uses the Accessibility Service API to provide \u2018Prevent turn off\u2019 feature. The optional feature blocks the user from turning the device off while the alarm is ringing so that they can wake up better.\r\n\r\n- Privacy Policy (English): http://alar.my/privacy_policy_en.txt\r\n- Email: cs@delightroom.com\r\n- Developer Contact: 368, Sapyeong-daero, Seocho-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea",
    "descriptionHTML": "Boost your motivation for successful mornings with Alarmy!<br>The wellness app for waking up and making a better sleep cycle.<br><br>\u25a0 No.1 Alarm clock &amp; Sleep App with 75M Users<br>Rated No. 1 in over 90 countries with 1.7M store reviews.<br>Selected as the 2023 Google Play App of the Year.<br><br>\u25a0 Waking up at once with Alarm Missions<br>Having trouble waking up with just a sound?<br>Try our variety of waking up missions:<br>math solving, memory games, shaking, or squats.<br><br>\u25a0 Special Alarm Clock for Heavy Sleepers<br>If you&#39;re a heavy sleeper who can&#39;t wake up with regular alarm clock,<br>our features like [ Power Off Prevention &amp; Anti-Snooze ] <br>will ensure you never fall back asleep.<br><br>\u25a0 Snore &amp; Sleep Tracker<br>Check if you snored last night<br>and whether you slept deeply using our sleep tracker,<br>which includes features to check the severity of snoring and your sleep cycle.<br><br>\u25a0 Quick and Deep Sleep with Calm Sleep Sounds<br>For those who struggle to fall asleep, <br>we offer a variety of calm sleep sounds:<br>calm ASMR, rain sounds, white noise.<br><br>\u25a0 Regular Night Routine with Bedtime Alarms<br>Creating a regular night routine habit can lead to more fresh mornings.<br>Remind bedtime at your set schedule and turn on calm sleep sounds.<br>It&#39;ll boost motivation for building a habit of going to bed regularly for a better sleep routine.<br><br>--<br><br>\u25b6\ufe0e Recommended for:<br>- Those who set multiple alarms minutes apart<br>- People who work early or night shifts<br>- Anyone looking for a stronger alarm than the Google clock or Apple alarm clock<br>- Those who need to improve their sleep routine due to chronic fatigue<br>- People curious about whether they snore or not<br>- Those who need various calm sleep sounds to fall asleep easily<br>- Those who want to make successful morning &amp; evening habit with the full motivation<br>- Anyone needs a free sleep tracker to make regular sleep cycle<br><br>--<br><br>\u25b6 Life Hacking Tips with Alarmy<br><br>*Morning Study Routine: Study Habit<br>1. Choose &#39;Photo Mission&#39; as the alarm dismissal mission<br>2. Set the cover of the book you will study as the photo mission.<br>3. Then, you can start studying as soon as the alarm goes off and build a habit!<br><br>*Night Sleep Routine: Habit to Combat Insomnia<br>1. Set your target sleeping time and set up a &#39;Bedtime Reminder&#39; and wake-up alarm.<br>2. When it&#39;s bedtime, turn on the sleep tracker and calm sounds.<br>3. Maintain this routine for over 5 days to see changes in your sleep cycle, and complete your perfect night routine!<br><br>--<br><br>Alarmy is daily source of motivation for morning waking up,<br>but it also offers various sleeping functions.<br><br>Sleeping well is crucial for waking up easily,<br>which is why we provide calm sleep sounds and sleep tracker related to forming sleep cycle for free.<br><br>Experience all the features to spark your motivation of successful morning <br>and a healthy routine, habit all at once with Alarmy!<br><br>Free features: alarm clock, sleep tracker, sleep sounds etc.<br><br>#clock #clock app #alarm clock #clock widget #loud #motivation #sleep cycle #sleep sounds #sleep tracker #habit #rem sleep #calm #sleep recorder<br><br>--<br><br>PERMISSIONS<br>SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW (Android window permission)<br>Needed for displaying the alarm dismissal screen on Android 10 and above.<br><br>OPTIONAL PERMISSIONS<br>Service can be used without agreement, except for:<br><br>- Write External Storage: Needed to load external ringtones.<br>- Camera: Required for photo missions where users need to take pictures.<br>- Read External Storage: Needed to save photos taken by users in photo missions.<br>- Location Information: Needed to obtain weather information after the app is closed.<br>- Device Manager: Used to prevent the app from being uninstalled.<br><br>Alarmy uses the Accessibility Service API to provide \u2018Prevent turn off\u2019 feature. The optional feature blocks the user from turning the device off while the alarm is ringing so that they can wake up better.<br><br>- Privacy Policy (English): http://alar.my/privacy_policy_en.txt<br>- Email: cs@delightroom.com<br>- Developer Contact: 368, Sapyeong-daero, Seocho-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea",
